Importing an existing hosts file via :ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.infra.hosts_file` is deprecated. Hosts can be defined directly via Nix now. The option ``hosts_file`` will be removed at some point in the future. If you want to keep providing your own hosts file after that, convert it to YAML format (see https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/inventory_guide/intro_inventory.html ) and import it like this ``ansible_hosts = yk8s-libs.importYAML ./hosts;``.
